hadiths[51]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1619","Hazrat Jabir bin rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh hzrt amr khtab rzy allh anh nay anhyn mtla kya kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh w slm kw frmatay sna:\n\n\myn yhwdywn awr nsaryٰ kw jzyrh arb say akhraj krwn ga۔\"""""""
"1620","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke: Fatimah (رضي الله عنها) Abu Bakr (رضي الله عنه) ke paas aain aur unhon ne pucha: \Tumhare baad tumhare waris kaun honge?\"" Unhon ne farmaya: \""Mere aulad aur mere khandan.\"" Fatimah (رضي الله عنها) ne kaha: \""Toh mujhe kya? Mere baap se meri miras nahi milegi?\"" Abu Bakr (رضي الله عنه) ne farmaya: \""Main ne Rasoolullah (ﷺ) se suna hai ke: 'Hum waris nahi kiye jaate.' Lekin main un logon ki madad karta hoon jin ki madad Rasoolullah (ﷺ) karte the.\"""""""
"1621","Abu Hurairah (Razi Allah unho se) ne riwayat ki ke Fatimah (Razi Allah unho se) Abu Bakr aur Umar (Razi Allah unho se) ke paas aain."
"1622","Malik bin Aws bin Al-Hadathan (rz all anh) nay byan kya: myn amr bn khtab (rz all anh) kay pas aaya۔ (phr) asman bn afan (rz all anh) aayay۔"
"1623","Al-Harith bin Malik bin Al-Barsa' (رضي الله عنه) ne bayan farmaya: \Fatah-e-Makki ke din...\"""""""
"1624","Nu'man bin Muqarrin (رضي الله عنه) ne bayan farmaya: \Main Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ke saath jihad mein shamil tha.\"""""""
"1625","Ma'qil bin Yasar rivayet karte hain ke \Umar bin Al-Khattab ne An-Nu'man bin Muqarrin ko Al-Hurmuzan ke paas bheja.\"" Aur yeh hadith poori zikar ki gayi. An-Nu'man bin Muqarrin ne kaha: \""Main Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke saath jang mein hissa le chuka hoon. Jab aam taraqqi ke waqt mein jang na hoti"","" toh hum subah ki ibtida mein qital na karte the.\"""""""
"1626","Abdullah bin Mas'ud (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \n\altyrh (bdfaly ya shgwn ka rwaj) shrk myn say hay۔\"""""""
"1627","\Na 'Adwa (بیماری کا خود بخود پھیلنا) hai aur na Tiyarah (بدشگونی یا فال بد).\"""""""""""""
"1628","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh nby krym (sly allh alyh wslm) jb ksy kam kay lyay nkltay tw khwsh hwtay agr anhyn yh snayy dyta: \aay rah pr chlnay walay!\"""""""
"1629","hds ka ardw trjmh\n\ntrjmh:\n\nhmyn hdad nay rwayt ky، hmyn wkya nay rwayt ky، sfyan say، abdalmlk bn amyr s، atyh qrzy say، anhwn nay fryaya:\n\n\hm qryzay kay dn rswl allh ﷺ kay pysh kyay gyay thay۔ hm myn say jn kay blwgh ky nshanyan zahr hw chky thyn (yany jn pr bal aa chkay thay)، anhyn qtl kya gya، awr jn kay play myn abhy yh nshanyan zahr nhyn hwyy thyn، anhyn aazad kr dya gya۔ myn an lwgwn myn say tha jn kay play myn abhy blwgh ky nshanyan zahr nhyn hwyy thyn، as lyay mjhay aazad kr dya gya\""\n\nabw aysy (trmzy) nay frmaya: *\""yh hsn shyh hds hay\""*\n\n\n\ntalqy tshryh:\n\nabw aysy trmzy nay mzyd frmaya kh yh aml ahl alm kay baz almaa nay apnaya tha، jnhwn nay balwn ky nmw (*albanh*) kw shray blwgh kay nshanay kay twr pr tslym kya jb frd ky amr awr ahtlam ka tjrbh qaym nh hw skta tha۔ yh amam ahmd bn hnbl awr ashaq bn rahwyh (allh an pr rhm frmayay) ka mwqf tha\n\n\n\nahm astlahat:\n\n- albanh (alnbat): khray balwn ky nmw، jw rwaytaً shray blwgh (*blwgh*) kay jsmy nshanay kay twr pr aslamy fqh myn astamal hwta hay\n- blwgh (alblwgh): aslamy qanwn myn shray blwgh/balgh hwna۔"""""
"1630","Woh (s.a.w.) usay apne mutaliq Allah ka taqwa ikhtiyaar karne ki wasiyat karte aur Musalmanon ke saath rehne walon ke saath neik sulook karne ki bhi wasiyat karte. Woh farmaate: \Allah ke naam se"","" Allah ki raah mein jung karo. Un logon se lado jo Allah ke saath kufr karte hain"","" aur ghanimat se na chori karo"","" na khayanti karo"","" na muthla karo"","" aur na bachche ko maaro. Jab tum apne mushrik dushmanon se milen"","" to unhe teen ikhtiyaaraton ya khayaraat mein se ek ki taraf bulao"","" jis mein se woh jawab den to usay qubool karo aur un se baaz raho. Unhe Islam ki taraf bulaao"","" aur apni zameen se Muhajireen ki zameen mein hijrat karne ki taraf bulaao. Unhe batao ke agar woh aisa karen to unhe Muhajireen ke saath jaisa haq milega aur un se bhi waise hi farz hoga jaise Muhajireen se farz hai. Aur agar woh hijrat se inkaar karen to unhe batao ke woh Musalmanon ke andar Badwi ki tarah honge aur unhe Badwi ke saath jaisa sulook kiya jayega. Unke liye na ghanimat hogi na Fay'"","" jab tak ke woh Musalmanon ke saath jung na karen. Agar woh inkaar karen to Allah se unke khilaf madad maango aur un se lado. Aur agar tum kisi qila ko ghera lagao aur woh tum se Allah ka ahad aur apne Nabi ka ahad chahein to tum Allah ka ahad aur apne Nabi ka ahad na do. Balki apna ahad aur apne sahaba ka ahad do"","" kyunki Allah aur uske Rasool ka ahad todna se yeh behtar hai. Aur agar tum kisi qila ke logon ko ghera lagao aur woh Allah ke hukm par muzakera karne ke liye ghera utaarne ka kahein to ghera na utaaro"","" balki unhe apne hukm ke saamne akele kar do"","" kyunki tum nahi jaante ke tum unke mutaliq Allah ke hukm par pahunchoge ya nahi.\"" Ya isi tarah ki baatein."""""
"1631","awr brydh ky hdys ayk hsn shyh hdys hay\njama trmzy hdys: arby hdys:"
"1632","Ibn Abi 'Umar ne hamse riwayat ki, Sufyan ibn 'Uyaynah ne riwayat ki, 'Amr ibn Dinar se, Bajalah se, ke Umar (radi Allahu 'anho) Majoos se jizyah nahi lete the, jab tak 'Abd al-Rahman ibn 'Awf (radi Allahu 'anho) ne unhe bataya ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne Hajar ke Majoos se jizyah li thi. Aur is hadith mein isse zyada kalam bhi hai. Ye hasan sahih hadith hai."
"1633","Agar us azaan sun leta, to ruk jaata; agar nahi suna, to hamla kar leta. Ek din usne azaan suni aur ek shakhs bol raha tha: \Allahu Akbar"""","""" Allahu Akbar.\"""" Usne kaha: \""""Fitrah par ho.\"""" Phir woh shakhs bola: \""""Main gawah hoon ke Allah ke siwa koi haqeeqat mein parastidaar nahi.\"""" Usne kaha: \""""Tu Aag se nikal gaya.\""""\n\nYeh riwayat ek silsile mein mukhtalif asaneed ke saath rawana hai.\n\nAbu 'Eisa (rahimahullah) ne farmaya: \""""Yeh hadith Hasan Sahih hai.\""""\n\nJam' al-Tirmidhi"""","""" Hadith: 1618; Arabi Hadith: 1618."""""""""
"1634","Hazrat Uqbah ibn Amir (Razi Allah unhu) se marwi hain:\n\nUnhon ne farmaya: \Maine kaha: 'Ya Rasool Allah ﷺ"""","""" hum kisi qaum ke paas se guzarte hain jo humare mehmaan nawazi nahi karte"""","""" na hi un par humari haqooq ada karte hain"""","""" aur hum un se kuch bhi zabardasti nahi lete.' Aap ﷺ ne farmaya: 'Agar woh inkar kar dein siwaye is ke tum zabardasti le lo"""","""" to tum zabardasti le lo.'\""""\n\nAbu Isa Tirmizi (Rahmatullah alaih) ne farmaya: Ye ek *hasan* (achhi) hadith hai. Layth ibn Sa'd ne bhi ise Yazid ibn Abi Habib se riwayat ki hai. Is hadith ka matlab"""","""" jaisa ke tafsir mein bayan kiya gaya hai"""","""" yeh hai ke woh ghazwaat mein nikalte aur kisi qaum ke paas se guzarte jahan se woh kharidne ke liye khaana nahi milta tha. Toh Nabi ﷺ ne farmaya: 'Agar woh bechne se inkar kar dein siwaye is ke tum zabardasti le lo"""","""" to tum zabardasti le lo.' Is tarah kuch riwayaat mein iska tafsir bhi saath mein aaya hai. Aur Hazrat Umar ibn Khattab (Razi Allah unhu) se bhi yeh marwi hai ke woh bhi isi tarah ka hukm dete the.\n\n\n\n*— Sunan al-Tirmidhi se iqtibas*"""""""""
"1635","Hadees ka Anas bin Malik (razi Allahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: matlab yeh ke Allah Ta'ala farmate hain: \Jo shaks mere raaste mein jihad karta hai...\"""""""
"1636","Fazalah bin 'Ubaid (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \jw shkhs mwt kay wqt as kh aamal mhr hw jatay hyn، swayay as shkhs kay jw dshmn kay khlaf srhd pr ngrany krtay hwyay mray۔\"""""""
"1637","Qutaybah ne hamse riwayat ki, Hatim bin Isma'il ne Yazid bin Abi Ubayd se riwayat ki, unhone kaha: Main ne Salamah bin Al-Akwa' (رضي الله عنه) se pucha, \Aap ne Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke saath Hudaybiyyah ke din kis cheez par bai'at ki thi?\"" Unhon ne farmaya"","" \""Maut par.\"" Ye ek hasan sahih hadith hai."""""
"1638","Abu Sa’id Al-Khudri (رَضِيَ ٱللَّٰهُ عَنْهُ) ne riwayat karte hain ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Bandah Allah ki raaste mein ek rozay rakhta hai magar iske siwa ke\"""""""
"1639","hdys ka trjmh\n\nhdys abnِ mnya kay wastay rwayt ky gyy، abnُ ayynh nay abwalzbyr say، abwalzbyr nay jabr bnِ abdallh (rzَ allُ anُ) say rwayt ky، kha: hm nay rswlُ allh (sly allُ alyِ wslm) kay hmrah byat mwt pr nhyn ky thy؛ blkh hm nay an say byat yh ky thy kh hm frar nhyn kryn gay۔ abw aysyٰ (almyrzy) nay frmaya: yh hdys hsn shyh hay۔ dwnwn ahadys ka many shyh hay۔ an kay kchh shabh (rzَ allُ anm) nay an say byat mwt pr ky thy، yh khh kr: \hm aap kay samnay rhyn gay yhan tk kh hmara qtl hw jayay،\"" awr kchh nay byat yh ky، kha: \""hm frar nhyn kryn gay۔\"""""""
"1640","Khuraim bin Fatik (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \jw shkhs allh ky rah myn kchh bhy khrch kray...\"""""""
"1641","Hazrat 'Adi bin Hatim at-Tai (Razi Allahu Anhu) ne rivayat karte hain ke unhone Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se sawal kiya."
"1642","Abu Umamah (rzَ allُ anُ) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh (sl allُ alِ wslm) nay frmaya: \n\sdqay ka sb say afzl tryqh wh hay jw allh ky rah myn khymay ka sayh hw۔\"""""""
"1643","Zaid bin Khalid Al-Juhani (رضي الله عنہ) سے روایت ہے کہ رسول اللہ (ﷺ) نے فرمایا:"
"1644","Zaid bin Khalid Al-Juhani (رضي الله عنهم) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ne farmaya:"
"1645","Zaid bin Khalid Al-Juhani (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat kih ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne isi tarah farmaya."
"1646","Zaid bin Khalid Al-Juhani (رضي الله عنهم) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya:"
"1647","Yazid bin Abu Maryam ne riwayat ki: \Abayah bin Rifa'ah bin Rafi' (رضي الله عنہ) ne mujh se mulaqat ki jab Main Jum'ah ki namaz ke liye ja raha tha. Unhon ne farmaya: 'Mubarakbaad!'\"""""""
"1648","Qutaybah ne riwayat ki, jo ʿAbd al-ʿAzīz ibn Muhammad se, jo Suhayl ibn Abi Salih se, jo apne walid se, jo Abu Hurairah رضي الله عنه se, Rasool Allah ﷺ ne farmaya:\n\n\Yahood aur Nasara ko salam se pehle mat khawo. Aur agar tum mein se kisi ko raaste mein koi un mein se mil jaye to use raaste ki tang tareeq par majboor karo.\""""\n\n(Unhone) kaha: \""""Is bab mein Ibn Umar"""","""" Anas aur Abu Basrah al-Gifari رضي الله عنهم se bhi riwayatein hain"""","""" jo Sahaba-e-Kiram mein se hain.\""""\n\nAbu Isa (al-Tirmidhi) ne kaha: \""""Yeh ek hasan sahih hadith hai.\""""\n\nIs Hadith ka matlab — \""""Yahood aur Nasara ko salam se pehle mat khawo\"""" — Ahl-e-Ilm mein se baaz ne is tarah bayan kiya hai: \""""Karahiyat ki wajah yeh hai ke yeh unki izzat ka sabab banata hai. Balki Musalmanon ko unhe zaleel karne ka hukm diya gaya hai. Isi tarah agar kisi ko raaste mein un mein se koi mile to usay raaste se hatna chahiye nahi"""","""" kyunke yeh bhi unki izzat ka sabab hai.\""""\n\n\n\n*Yeh Hadith Sahih Muslim aur Jami al-Tirmidhi mein darj hai"""","""" aur yeh Ahl-e-Kitab se muamlat"""","""" khasoosan salam aur raaste ke muamlat ke ahkam se mutalliq hai.*"""""""""
"1649","Shurahbil bin As-Samt ne riwayat ki: \Aey Ka'b bin Murrah! Aap Rasoolullah (ﷺ) se kuch naqal karein.\"""""""
"1650","Hazrat Amr bin Abasah (Razi Allah Anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Jis shakhs ke Allah ki raaste mein baal safed ho gaye...\"""""""
"1651","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Ghodon ke jadain qayamat ke din tak mein bhalai hain. Ghora teen (maqsadon) ke liye hai: ek aadmi ke liye uska ajar hai\"""""""
"1652","Abu Najih As-Sulami (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke maine Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ko farmaate suna: \Jis shakhs ne Allah ki raah mein ek teer chalaaya...\"""""""
"1653","Ibn 'Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) ne riwayat ki ke maine Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ko farmaate suna:"
"1654","Hazrat Anas (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \allh ky rah myn shhadt hr gnah ka kfarh hay۔\"" jbrayyl (alyh alslam) nay kha: \""qrz kay swa۔\"" tw rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \""qrz kay swa\""\n\nabw aysy (amam trmzy) nay kha: as mwzwa pr kab bn ajrh (rz all anh) say bhy rwayat hyn۔"""""
"1655","Ka'b bin Malik (rzy allh anh) apnay wald (malk bn skhr rzy allh anh) say rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \shhydwn ky rwhyn sbz prndwn myn hwty hyn۔\"""""""
"1656","Al-Hasan ibn Ali al-Khallāl ne hamari taraf se riwāyat bayaan ki, unhone kaha ke Bishr ibn ʿUmar ne hamain ittilāʿ dī, unhone kaha ke Mālik ibn Anas ne hamari taraf se riwāyat ki, woh Ibn Shihāb se riwāyat karte hain, aur woh Mālik ibn Aws ibn al-Ḥadathān se riwāyat karte hain, unhone kaha:\n\nMain ʿUmar ibn al-Khaṭṭāb (Raz.) ke paas gaya, aur ʿUthmān ibn ʿAffān (Raz.), al-Zubayr ibn al-ʿAwwām (Raz.), ʿAbd al-Raḥmān ibn ʿAwf (Raz.), aur Saʿd ibn Abī Waqqāṣ (Raz.) bhi unke paas ā gaye. Phir ʿAlī (Raz.) aur al-ʿAbbās (Raz.) āe, aur āpas mein jhagṛe lage. ʿUmar (Raz.) ne un se kaha:\n\n\Main tumhen us Allah se qasam dilātā hūn jis ke hukm se āsmān aur zameen qāim hain — kya tum jaante ho ke Rasūlullāh ﷺ ne farmāyā tha: 'Hum koi mīrās nahīn chhoṛte; jo kuch ham chhoṛe woh ṣadaqah hai.'\""""\n\nUnhon ne kaha: \""""Jī hān.\""""\n\nʿUmar (Raz.) ne kaha: \""""Jab Rasūlullāh ﷺ ko Allāh Taʿālā ne wafāt dī"""","""" to Abū Bakr (Raz.) ne kaha: 'Main Rasūlullāh ﷺ ke walī (jāneśīn) hūn.' Tum aur yānī ʿAlī (Raz.) aur al-ʿAbbās (Raz.) dono Abū Bakr (Raz.) ke paas āe — tum apne bhatīje kī mīrās māṅgte aur yeh apnī bāp kī mīrās māṅgte. To Abū Bakr (Raz.) ne kaha: 'Beshak Rasūlullāh ﷺ ne farmāyā tha: \""""Hum koi mīrās nahīn chhoṛte; jo kuch ham chhoṛe woh ṣadaqah hai.\"""" Aur Allāh Taʿālā jaanta hai ke woh (Rasūl ﷺ) sachche"""","""" nēk"""","""" hidaāyat yāftā aur haq par chalne wāle the.'\""""\n\nAbū ʿĪsā (al-Tirmidhī) ne farmāyā: \""""Is hadīth mein ek lambī qissah hai.\""""\n\nAur yeh Mālik ibn Anas (Raz.) ki riwāyat se ek ḥasan ṣaḥīḥ gharīb hadīth hai (Allāh Taʿālā sab par raẓī ho)."""""""""
"1657","Muhammad ibn Bashshar ne riwayat ki, Yahya ibn Sa'id ne riwayat ki, Zakariyya ibn Abi Za'idah ne riwayat ki, al-Sha'bi se, al-Harith ibn Malik ibn al-Barsa' se, unhone kaha: Maine Nabi ﷺ ko Makkah ki fath ke din suna, unhone farmaya: \Aaj ke baad se yeh shehar qayamat tak ladaai ka maqsad nahi hoga.\"" Abu Isa ne kaha: Is bab mein Ibn Abbas"","" Sulayman ibn Surad aur Mu'ti' ki bhi riwayatein hain. Yeh hasan sahih hadith hai aur yeh Zakariyya ibn Abi Za'idah ki hadith hai al-Sha'bi se; hum ise sirf uski riwayat ke siwa nahi jaante."""""
"1658","Fazlah bin Ubaid ne riwayat ki ke unhone Umar bin Al-Khattab (رضي الله عنه) ko yeh kehte hue suna ke maine Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ko farmaate hue suna ke \Shaheed chaar qism ke hote hain: Ek momin mard jis ki iman achhi ho"""""
"1659","Ishaq bin Abdullah bin Abi Talhah ne riwayat ki ke unhone Anas (radiyallahu anhu) se suna ke: \Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Umm Haram bint Milhan (radiyallaha anha) ke paas aate the.\"""""""
"1660","Abu Musa (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (ﷺ) se kisi aadmi ke baare mein sawaal gaya jo himmat se ladta hai..."
"1661","Hazrat Umar bin Al-Khattab (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Aamaal to sirf niyyat ke saath hain.\"""""""
"1662","Sahl bin Sa'd As-Sa'idi (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \allh ky rah myn sbh kw nklna dnya awr dnya myn jw kchh hay as say bhtr hay۔ awr jnt myn chhry ky jgh (ka hjm) dnya awr dnya myn jw kchh hay as say bhtr hay۔\"" [abw aysyٰ khtay hyn:] as mwzwa pr abw hryrh (rzy allh anh) ky rwayat mwjwd hyn۔"""""
"1663","Abu Hurairah aur Ibn 'Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se marwi hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Subah Allah ki raah mein nikalna...\"""""""
"1664","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki: Nabi (ﷺ) ke Sahaba mein se ek shakhs ek wadi se guzra jis mein ek chhoti si pyaas bujhane wali chashma tha."
"1665","\Subah ko Allah ki raah mein nikalna"""""""""
"1666","Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se marwi hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Kya tumhein main nahi bataun ke logon mein se behtarein kaun hai? Woh shakhs jo Allah ki raah mein apne ghode ki lagaam pakadta hai. Kya tumhein main nahi bataun ke uske baad kaun hai? Woh shakhs jo logon se apni chhoti si bakrion ke saath tanha rehne lage.\"""""""
"1667","eik ghulam aaya, usney Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey hijrat par baiat ki, Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam nahin jantey they ke wo ghulam hai, itney mein uska Malik aa gaya, Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''mujhey usey bech do'', phir aap ney usko do kaley ghulam dekar kharid liya, uskey baad aap ney kisi sey baiat nahin li jab tak ussey ye na poochh letey ke kya wo ghulam hai? Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan sahih gharib hai, 2- hum is ko sirf abu-Zubair ki riwayat sey jantey hain, padhi. 3- is bab mein ibne-Abbas Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi riwayat hai,"
"1668","mainey kaee aurton key sath Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey baiat ki, aap ney hum sey farmaya : ''itaat is mein lazim hai jo tum sey ho sakey aur jiski tumhen taqat ho'', mainey kaha : Allah aur uskey Rasool hum par khud hum sey ziyada meharban hain, mainey arz kya : Allah key Rasool! hum sey baiat liijiye (Sufiyan bin Uena kehtey hain : unka matlab tha musaafa keejiye), Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''tum so aurton key liye mera qol merey us qol jaisa hai jo eik aurat key liye hai''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, hum isey sirf Muhammad bin Munkadir hi ki riwayat sey jantey hain, Sufiyan Sory, Malik bin Anas aur kaee logon ney Muhammad bin Munkadir sey isi jaisi hadees riwayat ki hai, 2- mainey Muhammad bin Ismail Bukhari sey is hadees key barey mein puchha to unhoney kaha : main Umaima bint Raqiqa ki uskey ilawa dusri koi hadees nahin janta hun, 3- Umaima naam ki eik dusri aurat bhi hain jinki Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey eik hadees aai hai. 4- is bab mein Aaisha, Abdullah bin umr aur Asma bint Yazeed (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"1669","hum log kaha kartey they ke ghazwa Badr key din badri log tadaad mein Talut key sathiyon key barabar teen so terah they . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, 2- Sory aur doosrey logon ney bhi Abu-Is'haq Sabeei sey uski riwayat ki hai, padhi. 3- is bab mein ibne-Abbas sey bhi riwayat hai,"
